# Source-data note

The signal-extraction inputs to this dataset (Mad Money episode transcripts and
the resulting structured recommendation records) were generated by the
[finfluencers.trade](https://finfluencers.trade) platform. The CSVs published
in this repository are the post-processed, paper-aligned views of that data.

The underlying CNBC *Mad Money* broadcast content is the property of CNBC /
NBCUniversal and is not redistributed here. This repository contains only
derivative analytical metadata (tickers, dates, computed returns, classifications)
and short verbatim quotes used as evidence for hold-state classification under
fair-use principles.

